public/signs/wlasl/
  Sign keyframes derived from the WLASL dataset (Li et al., "Word-level Deep
  Sign Language Recognition from Video", WACV 2020,
  https://github.com/dxli94/WLASL). Licensed under the Computational Use of
  Data Agreement (C-UDA): academic and computational use only, NO COMMERCIAL
  USE. The source videos belong to their original publishers and are not
  included in this repository.

public/models/aria/
  "Business_Female_01" from the Microsoft Rocketbox avatar library
  (https://github.com/microsoft/Microsoft-Rocketbox), MIT licence. See
  public/models/aria/LICENSE.md.

Runtime libraries loaded from CDNs and not included here: three.js (MIT),
MediaPipe Tasks Vision and models (Apache 2.0), Google Fonts (SIL OFL).
